      "id": "overview",
      "title": "Overview",
      "text": "Leak detection systems watch a pipeline or facility continuously and raise the alarm when something changes — by monitoring flow and pressure balances, or by sensing gas directly. We engineer, integrate and support these systems as part of the control and safety architecture."
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
